    {
      "Original": "These plugin lists are dynamically generated and not vetted. They may contain malware or jeopardize your account. Proceed with caution. If you're installing plugins from custom repositories, DO NOT ask for help on the XIVLauncher discord. Please review the plugin's README for support.",
